OL,3,GNEWSASome surgeries and visits paused
OL,4,Aafter leak at Raigmore Hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Highland has said a water leak on
OL,7,Fthe sixth floor of Raigmore Hospital in
OL,8,FInverness had affected a number of
OL,9,Fareas of the building.
OL,11,FThe health board said some planned
OL,12,Fsurgery was paused and visitors have
OL,13,Fbeen asked not to see patients in wards
OL,14,Fon the fourth and fifth for the next
OL,15,Ffew days.
OL,17,FIt said the leak had been contained.
OL,19,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,20,Fsaid it was called to assist with a
OL,21,Fburst pipe at about midday and the crew
OL,22,Fleft about 20 minutes later.
